# Applies to every `docker build` in this repo (build context = repo root,
# needed so multi-stage builds can see every pnpm workspace package).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Prisma-generated clients (packages/db-platform's custom `output` path —
# see that package's schema.prisma) — regenerated fresh inside every build
# stage that needs them (`prisma generate` targets the container's own
# platform/Prisma version), so a stale host-local copy should never ship.
**/generated
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

.git
.github

# Secrets — never end up in a build context/image layer, even though a
# top-level .dockerignore also protects nested Dockerfiles.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

infra/postgres/data
infra/minio/data
infra/traefik/certs/*
!infra/traefik/certs/.gitkeep

*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

Business Requirement Document - CRM.docx
